# Lassoed by the Law {3}{W}: "When this enchantment enters, exile target nonland permanent an opponent controls until this
# enchantment leaves the battlefield." and "When this enchantment enters, create a 1/1 red Mercenary creature token...". On turn
# three both triggers go on the stack: the first offers Bot2's Ornithopter and not Bot1's own Ornithopter or Bot2's Plains. The
# Mercenary token is new that turn, so its {T} ability is refused (summoning sick). On turn four Bot2's Disenchant destroys
# Lassoed by the Law and the Ornithopter comes back under its owner's control as a new object.

